      "cooked": "<p>Hi community,</p>\n<p>We have an issue with Return Employee Advance. I tried to read &amp; ask from some similar topic but still not get the satisfactory answer.</p>\n<p>Hope that anyone was faced with same issue can share us experience and solution.</p>\n<p><strong>Issue</strong>: <em>Account 12300 - Advances to employees - Vsilicon and Party Type Employee have different account types</em></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/b/dbeda5f0ad5ac187a239b91fab68aa2e3c3e43ee.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/dbeda5f0ad5ac187a239b91fab68aa2e3c3e43ee\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/b/dbeda5f0ad5ac187a239b91fab68aa2e3c3e43ee_2_690x285.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vnzIWJrnrXcgEOnsA85TUK1YsLI\" width=\"690\" height=\"285\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/b/dbeda5f0ad5ac187a239b91fab68aa2e3c3e43ee_2_690x285.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/b/dbeda5f0ad5ac187a239b91fab68aa2e3c3e43ee_2_1035x427.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/b/dbeda5f0ad5ac187a239b91fab68aa2e3c3e43ee_2_1380x570.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"727272\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1902×787 65 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>Precondition:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Advance Employee Advance is <strong>Receivable</strong> account type as system requires ( default setup on Company)</li>\n<li>Party Type: Employee is <strong>Payable</strong> account type as company will pay salary for employee</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Flow:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Employee want to advance for Travel Business purchase, they submit an <strong>Employee Advance</strong> (ex: 1000 USD)</li>\n<li>Accountant create then submit an <strong>Payment Entry</strong> from Employee Advance with same amount (ex: 1000 USD)</li>\n<li>After Travel, they claim spent expenses by submitting an <strong>Expense Claim</strong> and select the above <strong>Employee Advance</strong>, the claim amount is less than advance amount (ex: 900 USD)</li>\n<li>Employee returns the remaining amount (100 USD) back to company, then accountant create '<strong>Journal Entry</strong> by clicking ‘Return’ from above <strong>Employee Advance</strong> transaction</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/7/17fbcddf1c4aa6260c748a569bd9ff26af719422.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/17fbcddf1c4aa6260c748a569bd9ff26af719422\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17fbcddf1c4aa6260c748a569bd9ff26af719422_2_690x168.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3qat7UuplI1M1NzwNDh9hPxMlfY\" width=\"690\" height=\"168\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17fbcddf1c4aa6260c748a569bd9ff26af719422_2_690x168.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17fbcddf1c4aa6260c748a569bd9ff26af719422_2_1035x252.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17fbcddf1c4aa6260c748a569bd9ff26af719422_2_1380x336.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1470×358 27.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The issue come from step 4, system don’t allow to submit the Journal Entry with below error message (mentioned above)<br>\n<em>Account 12300 - Advances to employees - Vsilicon and Party Type Employee have different account types</em></p>",
